    "RECEIPTS (frozen claim_batch packets, bare PASS/FAIL per cell, each a valid observation): on origin/main 84ef8e7d149 the four cells FAIL (base leg b2, scope 8918f4cf); on loop-a2-fold-driver 62cf283d68cf (gunbc#15997, a draft that changes none of those routes by source trace) the same four FAIL and every other cell matched expectation (scope 39d6edaa). So the cells are red at both pins; this shows the predicates fail at both pins, not a cause and not the absence of a regression introduced earlier.",

    "CAUSE UNKNOWN. Not inferred. The cells are bare Bool functions, so eval's Rejected reason, a non-None diagnostics list, or a value other than 5 are indistinguishable in the receipt.",

