t likewise; WHICH fires first (operand or result) is NOT established statically. TRACE B (run_test_claim, source only, SEPARATE from A): run_test_claim_runtime_evaluated evaluates the actual, then run_test_claim_runtime_assert (CompilesClaim arm) evaluates the expected literal with the SAME tree and interpretation and calls accepted_runtime_value_outcome_equality, which returns RuntimeValuesDiffer whenever the EXPECTED outcome is Rejected; runtime_value_equality_verdict maps Differ to verdict_fail = verdict_semantic_mismatch. The expected literal passes through the same per-node acceptance, so if A's type difference applies to it, the expected outcome is Rejected and SemanticMismatch follows irrespective of the actual; this is a CONSISTENT reading, and the executed receipt does not show the actual or expected outcomes, so it is UNVERIFIED. Source non-reach of #15997-changed paths (eval_loop_admission, eval_loop_node Loop arm, imports) by these cells remains SOURCE EVIDENCE, apart from executed evidence.",

